      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U04_L01_Q16</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.A2.EX.1</p><p>Which expression represents three repeated doublings of 9?</p>]]></text>
